---
alwaysApply: false
---

- scope: Cursor command + rule create/update/optimize
- default: self-contained | llm-optimized | token-friendly | enforcement-preserving
- refs.default: none
- refs.allowed: explicit user refs | `--ref-exceptions`
- refs.use: minimum necessary only
- refs.forbid: unapproved external refs
- command.apply-rule: allowed
- duplication.forbid: rule vs command
- duplication.forbid: rule vs allowed refs
- duplication.forbid: repeated constraint variants
- wording: bullets only | shortened phrases | collapsed wording
- wording.forbid: full sentences | repetition | explanations | justification | obvious labels
- preserve: gates | stop conditions | constraints | output contracts | enforcement strength
- optimize: merge overlap | cut filler | shorten phrasing | keep exact intent
- create.rule.scope: explicit `alwaysApply` or `globs`; never implicit
- update.read-first: target files + applied rules + allowed refs
- update.delta-only: untouched behavior preserved
